[1942]
ID=NES-F060F1CF
Code=PASIOALE : Both players start with 9 rolls.
Code=IESUTYZA : Start with 6 lives for 1-player game only.
Code=AESUTYZE : Start with 9 lives for 1-player game only.
Code=IAKUUAZA : After a continue, player 1 has 6 lives in 2-player game.
Code=AAKUUAZE : After a continue, player 1 has 9 lives in 2-player game.
Code=IASUOAZA : Player 2 has 6 lives in 2-player game.
Code=AASUOAZE : Player 2 has 9 lives in 2-player game.

